y!\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTICE:**\n\n• Bring government issued ID; security restrictions at Pearl Harbor will be enforced. CLEAR BAGS ONLY (no non see-through bags that could offer concealment.) Storage is available at Pearl Harbor for $8.00 per item.\n\n• OUR TOURS DO NOT ALLOW GUESTS TO MEET DIRECTLY AT PEARL HARBOR.  GUESTS MUST MEET AT ONE OF THE PICK UP LOCATIONS OFFERED; YOU MAY NOT DRIVE OUT TO PEARL HARBOR ON YOUR OWN.\n\n• Attire: Dress comfortably, but please remember that shirts and footwear are required on the USS Arizona Memorial; swimsuits not permitted.  \n\n• Snacks and drinks are available and may be purchased independently at the Pearl Harbor Visitor Center gift shop.\n\n**NOTE:** Due to unforeseen circumstances beyond our control, the Navy may suspend boat operations to the USS Arizona Memorial at any time or impose a capacity restriction on the boat; as a result, occasionally, you may be placed in the standby line. Please accept our apologies in advance.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Tour 88 • Pick Up Starting at 11:00am", "short_description": null, "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6OoaRumCQ7WwcW4l80gz", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6OoaRumCQ7WwcW4l80gz", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/enoatours/items/42966/images/70871/", "pk": 70871, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Hty9kxAhQsGJfObtftZy", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Hty9kxAhQsGJfObtftZy", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/enoatours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/enoatours/items/42966/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Hty9kxAhQsGJfObtftZy", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Hty9kxAhQsGJfObtftZy", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "ur